#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[[quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appartifact]]`link:#quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appartifact[appArtifact]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Coordinates of the Maven artifact containing the original Java application to build the native image for. If not provided, the current project is assumed to be the original Java application.\n"
"The coordinates are expected to be expressed in the following format:\n"
"groupId:artifactId:classifier:type:version\n"
"With the classifier, type and version being optional.\n"
"If the type is missing, the artifact is assumed to be of type JAR.\n"
"If the version is missing, the artifact is going to be looked up among the project dependencies using the provided coordinates.\n"
"However, if the expression consists of only three parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:version.\n"
"If the expression consists of only four parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:classifier:type.\n"
"--"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appartifact[appArtifact]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "[[quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appartifact]]`link:#quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appartifact[appArtifact]`"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appartifact[appArtifact]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Coordinates of the Maven artifact containing the original Java application to build the native image for. If not provided, the current project is assumed to be the original Java application.\n"
"The coordinates are expected to be expressed in the following format:\n"
"groupId:artifactId:classifier:type:version\n"
"With the classifier, type and version being optional.\n"
"If the type is missing, the artifact is assumed to be of type JAR.\n"
"If the version is missing, the artifact is going to be looked up among the project dependencies using the provided coordinates.\n"
"However, if the expression consists of only three parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:version.\n"
"If the expression consists of only four parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:classifier:type."
msgstr "Coordenadas do artefato Maven que contém a aplicação Java original para a qual se deseja compilar a imagem nativa. Caso não sejam fornecidas, presume-se que o projeto atual seja a aplicação Java original. Espera-se que as coordenadas sejam expressas no seguinte formato: groupId:artifactId:classifier:type:version, sendo que o classificador, o tipo e a versão são opcionais. Caso o tipo não seja fornecido, presume-se que o artefato seja do tipo JAR. Caso a versão não seja fornecida, o artefato será procurado entre as dependências do projeto utilizando as coordenadas fornecidas. No entanto, se a expressão consistir em apenas três partes, presume-se que seja groupId:artifactId:version. Se a expressão consistir em apenas quatro partes, presume-se que seja groupId:artifactId:classifier:type."

